        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nanci Griffith\n- Products: The Best of Nanci Griffith, \"The Road to Aberdeen\"\n- Places: South Kensington, London\n- Venues: a concert venue on the northern edge of South Kensington\n\nFacts:\n- Nanci Griffith is associated with the compilation album The Best of Nanci Griffith.\n- The song \"The Road to Aberdeen\" appears on The Best of Nanci Griffith.\n- \"The Road to Aberdeen\" was recorded at a concert venue on the northern edge of South Kensington in London.\n- The Best of Nanci Griffith includes songs selected from a number of concerts held at that venue.",
